</div>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <figure>
    <img
      src="/assets/img/projects/astral-rift-rumble/gameplay-map.webp"
      alt="Gameplay from the custom Fortnite map with the Astral Rift Rumble broadcast overlay"
      width="822"
      height="465"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </figure>
  <div>
    <p class="big">A custom map, tested before it mattered</p>
    <p>
      The match ran on a custom UGC map built to bring the world of Honkai: Star
      Rail into Fortnite. Because untested maps are a live-show risk, we ran
      repeated playtests, tracked issues and worked directly with the map
      developer to fix them before the broadcast, and set up admin access and
      private lobby settings to keep the match controlled on show day.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <div>
    <p class="big">A broadcast built around the score</p>
    <p>
      We produced the two-hour broadcast for the official Epic Games Store
      channel, designing the graphics and show flow around the scoring so total
      eliminations surfaced clearly after every round and the tension held to
      the final result.
    </p>
  </div>
  <figure>
    <img
      src="/assets/img/projects/astral-rift-rumble/scoreboard.webp"
