</div>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Turning 14 streams into one campaign</p>
  <p>
    To keep fans engaged for the full two hours, we coordinated a synchronized
    push across every creator channel with pinned chat messages, chatbot
    reminders and Twitch panel graphics, and paired voting-based entry with a
    broadcast-exclusive giveaway so viewers had a reason to stay to the end.
  </p>
</div>

<h2>The Impact</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p>
    <b>43.3K peak concurrent viewers</b> across the creator streams, with
    viewership climbing steadily through the broadcast.
  </p>
  <p>
    <b>71M impressions and 13.9M views</b> across the event, from a single
    two-hour broadcast.
  </p>
  <p>
    <b>14 creators</b> from the Fortnite and Honkai: Star Rail communities
